  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initiative to Strengthen Identification Process of Victims of Trafficking in Persons in Istanbul</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the capacity of officials from the Units of Temporary Protection and Residence to increase the number of internal referrals for victim identification process. In addition, through provision of need-based in-cash and in-kind assistance such as delivering interpretation services for victim identification interviews, transportation, accommodation, food and non-food items, psychosocial support, access to legal and health services and others, IOM aims to contribute to decreasing the protection risks of individuals who are either referred for victim identification processes or identified as victims.</narrative>
  </description>
